@startuml
!include ../_style.iuml
title Epic 6 — Robot integration (later phase)

rectangle "Robot (ROS 2)" {
  card US6_1 [
    **US-6.1  "Robot, find my bottle"**
    As a //robot operator//, I want to send a FindObject goal to the robot,
    so that it drives to where the object was last seen.
    ----
    * ROS 2 action FindObject: feedback = directions, result = target pose + mask.
    * Basir subscribes to camera, depth and /tf; publishes /basir/target_pose, /basir/mask and RViz markers.
  ]
  card US6_2 [
    **US-6.2  Paths, not straight lines (L3 navigable)**
    As a //robot operator//, I want directions that go around walls and through doors,
    so that the robot or person can actually follow them.
    ----
    * The SLAM occupancy map + Nav2 plan the path to the remembered position.
    * Tested in simulation (Isaac Sim / Gazebo) before the real robot.
  ]
}
US6_1 -[hidden]down- US6_2
@enduml
